[Agent thinking]
Intention: osquery:results has no file-inventory pack (only process monitoring, shell history, largest_process), and my earlier ".jpeg" term search may have missed filenames like "foo.jpeg" because the period is a minor breaker in Splunk term segmentation. I'll extract any .jpeg/.jpg string from raw osquery events with rex, which bypasses segmentation entirely.



